# Lexify — workflow

Loyiha: **Lexify**. Ish: shu papka, `http://localhost:3000`, production `https://lexify.zonic.fit`.

## Taqiqlangan

https://open.okina.uz va uning serveriga (deploy, SSH, migrate, SSL) **hech qachon** tegilmasin.

## UI

O‘zgarishdan oldin tushunganingni tasdiqla — tasdiqlanmaguncha kod yozma.

## Git va deploy

Kod o‘zgagach **avtomatik** commit/push/deploy qilma. Ish tugagach bir marta so‘ra. Faqat «qil» desagina: commit, `git push -u manba main`, keyin Lexify serveriga deploy. `.env` va `.pem` commit qilinmasin.

